# Pepito: let the GSF-ID publisher set its property.
#
# The pepito_gsfid domain itself is declared in AOSP plat policy
# (system/sepolicy/private/pepito_gsfid.te) — it HAS to be, because the
# neverallow exemptions it needs live in plat domain.te/mlstrustedsubject.te and
# plat policy cannot reference a type declared out here in the device tree.
#
# This rule stays device-side because pepito_gsf_prop is device-side; system_ext
# policy may reference plat types, which is the direction that works.
set_prop(pepito_gsfid, pepito_gsf_prop)
